      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We were very pleased we went with Green Energy Options to install our Solar system. We had very limited roof space to install our panels (which had to face west), so we went for the LG 320W panels (8 panels - 2.55kW) with the Enphase inverters. Aaron was very knowledgeable with the proposed system and provided technical details about the system being offered. The installation was completed in about 6 hours safely and professionally. They also had the challenge of our steep roof (34Deg), however that was not a problem. Following installation, Aaron provided all the documentation, manuals, certificates etc during a follow up meeting. We are very confident that going forward we have a company that will provide further support if we required it.",
